Package: lomda
Type: Package
Title: Longitudinal Omics Multivariate Dimension-reduction Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-04-02
Authors@R: c(
    person("Your", "Name", email = "your.email@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000"))
  )
Description: Implements a two-stage method for the analysis of longitudinal
    omics data. Stage 1 applies Principal Component Analysis (PCA) to
    high-dimensional metabolomics (or other omics) measurements collected
    at multiple visits. Stage 2 fits a Linear Mixed Model (LMM) with a
    random intercept to the PC scores from Stage 1, enabling inference on
    time-related trajectories. The package provides estimation, likelihood
    ratio tests, and Wald tests for the time-effect slope, along with
    simulated example data and downstream visualization utilities
    (e.g. PC score plots, loadings, trajectory plots).
